#. module: base_name_search_improved
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:base_name_search_improved.view_model_form_new
msgid ""
"If \"Smart Search\" has been activated, searches will have a more \"relaxed\" behaviour. Odoo natively searches for records that include the phrases entered as they are entered. When activating this option it will search for records that contain entered words regardless of the order in which they are entered. For example if we search for a Contact \"Fred Flinstone\", Odoo would by default only return those records that contain exactly that phrase. With Smart Search active any record containing the words \"Fred\" and \"Flinstone\" will be returned.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"\n"
"                        By enabling Smart Search you can also add configure these two optional behaviours:"
msgstr ""
"Ako je \"Pametna pretraga\" aktivirana, pretrage će imati opuštenije ponašanje. Odoo uobičajeno traži zapise koji sadrže unesene fraze tačno onako kako su unesene. Kada omogućite ovu opciju, pretraga će pronalaziti zapise koji sadrže unesene riječi bez obzira na redoslijed. Na primjer, ako tražimo kontakt \"Fred Flinstone\", Odoo bi podrazumijevano vratio samo zapise koji sadrže upravo tu frazu. Sa aktivnom Pametnom pretragom biće vraćen svaki zapis koji sadrži riječi \"Fred\" i \"Flinstone\".\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"\n"
"                        Omogućavanjem Pametne pretrage možete dodatno podesiti i ova dva opcionalna ponašanja:"

